{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOOPR is a puzzle platformer where the goal is to loop through different variations of the same level to win! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987140/extras/0e9476c6506edcf3613737342fb2a6eb.poster.avif?t=1774732280\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987140/extras/0e9476c6506edcf3613737342fb2a6eb.webm?t=1774732280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987140/extras/0e9476c6506edcf3613737342fb2a6eb.mp4?t=1774732280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">These level variations contain what are known as &quot;Artifacts&quot;. There are many different artifacts all with their own unique twist. Some artifacts could be used to jump across gaps that would otherwise be impossible. Others could allow you to jump across dangerous pits of lava, or whatever other dangers these levels may throw at you. Together, these artifacts create a unique puzzle solving experience, always throwing new challenges to solve your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987140/extras/3728732fd6c220893f3e1a29caf48722.poster.avif?t=1774732280\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987140/extras/3728732fd6c220893f3e1a29caf48722.webm?t=1774732280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987140/extras/3728732fd6c220893f3e1a29caf48722.mp4?t=1774732280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features (Currently in Development)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25+ unique levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ challenge levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ unique artifacts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level Editor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ragdoll Player Customization (it makes sense I swear)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3987140?t=1774732280","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3987140?t=1774732280","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987140/f4c74f34296b8de6c2d645c93c8c312cb16931ac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774732280","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987140/f4c74f34296b8de6c2d645c93c8c312cb16931ac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774732280","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4402460,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOOPR is a puzzle platformer where the goal is to loop through different variations of the same level to win! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987140/extras/0e9476c6506edcf3613737342fb2a6eb.poster.avif?t=1774732280\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987140/extras/0e9476c6506edcf3613737342fb2a6eb.webm?t=1774732280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse